From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chromium-blink-ios <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS V8: modular dual-mode JIT and TXM split-W^X memory substrate

Adds v8::base::IOSJitMemory (v8/src/base/platform/ios-jit-memory.{h,cc}) to
support runtime selection between jitless, BrowserEngineCore, native MAP_JIT
(Simulator / pre-TXM), and iOS 26/27 TXM split-W^X dual-mapped code ranges
(StikDebug universal.js brk #0xf00d + vm_remap RW alias) in one binary.

